&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Strategic thinker with the ability to design and execute long-term account plans that create mutual value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Strong business acumen to understand complex client business models and connect them to Mirakl&#39;s solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Outstanding communication skills for engaging and influencing senior stakeholders across multi-stakeholder, international environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Financial and analytical rigour to interpret complex contracts and assess revenue implications with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with the drive to proactively build pipeline and unlock new growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-my-4 s-border-b s-border-primary-150 dark:s-border-primary-150-night&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-lg s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;4. Tools Used&lt;/h3&gt;
