&lt;h3 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-lg s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;6. Our Hiring Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application, this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;s-list-decimal s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Intro call with Talent Acquisition&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— 30 minutes to explore your background, motivations, and answer any questions about Mirakl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Interview with Stanislas&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(VP Account Management Global) — Deep dive into your account management approach, commercial track record, and motivation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Values-based interviews&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— Conversations with colleagues from across the business to assess alignment with Mirakl&#39;s core values&lt;/li&gt;
